# cal-audio-analyzer
===
 Live sound and room acoustics analyzer: dual-channel transfer function, real-time spectrum, SPL metering, sweeps with RT60 and 3-D waterfall, alignment with crossover designer, EQ assistant with FIR export, feedback finder. Browser and desktop app for Windows, macOS and Linux.
